{"ts":"2026-08-09T00:15:13.406Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"b328d74ff33d5397acdbcabe","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-yrj7qr"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-942: expose the lightweight all-item metadata reader through the public SDK"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/942 reports that listAllItemMetadataLight already powers the cheap CLI list path but is not exported through the public SDK, forcing package authors to choose heavier reads or private imports. Promote a typed, bounded public primitive with PmClient and narrow subpath parity."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-09T00:15:13.406Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-09T00:15:13.406Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A documented public SDK primitive exposes the lightweight all-item metadata read without importing CLI or private core modules; top-level, narrow subpath, PmClient, and runtime action contracts have intentional parity; return types and omission semantics distinguish intentionally unavailable fields; import-cost, token, package-boundary, surface-snapshot, and complete coverage gates pass; a package-authoring example proves use from a compiled external consumer"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-usfg"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-te6elw","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-09T00:15:13.406Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-xpumg4","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-09T00:15:13.406Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-xzhz","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-09T00:15:13.406Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-09T00:15:13.406Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check: searched all statuses for listAllItemMetadataLight, cheap list, and SDK surface. The SDK-first epic and completed completeness/boundary items are adjacent lineage, but no item owns promotion of this exact lightweight reader reported in GH-942."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"8d19cbc3313427512d3b156bd2ea1881f77ef1a4ea4de2ce34da4845a12e2c08","message":""}
