{"ts":"2026-08-09T06:05:31.296Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7585198bf575ad9621c321e3","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":{"value":"pm-yrj7qr","source":"argv"},"version":{"value":"2.1.226","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-09T06:05:31.296Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Evidence sharpening the GH-942 framing, measured 2026-08-09 at host 2026.8.9.\n\nThe issue describes listAllItemMetadataLight as unexported. The stronger statement is that it is already declared as public and is not exported. It appears in sdk/public-surface.json at line 6049, which is the file that declares the SDK's public surface, while src/sdk/index.ts does not export it. Its only importers are internal: src/sdk/history-compact.ts, src/sdk/schema.ts (five call sites) and src/sdk/schema-migration.ts.\n\nSo the gap is not an omission from a list — it is a disagreement between two declarations of the same surface. An author who consults the declared public surface finds the symbol, and an author who consults the entrypoint cannot import it. Whichever one is authoritative, the other is currently lying, and no gate compares them.\n\nThis is the same producer/consumer parity shape recorded on pm-doxj at horizon AG: the surface has a declaration with no export behind it. Adding the export closes the issue; adding a gate that fails when public-surface.json names a symbol the entrypoint does not export closes the class.\n\nRelated measurement from the same pass: pm-sr3xzg records that the light reader is also the one src/sdk/governance/validate.ts line 3654 declines to use, loading every item body unconditionally instead."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-09T06:05:31.296Z"}],"before_hash":"793459c9ccaaa509368b3b6e71d4cb92f6bfa01d99c343e06143c9742b8994c4","after_hash":"4594303089c08fafa07638a504baa4bcf545d48b63bc885b18507009b0851c12"}
